# Tralee Masjid website

Static GitHub Pages site for Kerry Islamic Cultural Centre. No framework, no transpilation.

## Stack

- HTML pages at repo root (`index.html`, `about.html`, `contact.html`, `activities.html`, `madrasa.html`, `projects.html`)
- CSS: `assets/css/main.css`, `assets/css/animations.css`
- JS: single file `assets/js/scripts-{timestamp}.js` (IIFE, ES6+)
- Bootstrap 4, jQuery, Font Awesome, BaguetteBox via CDN
- Gulp + BrowserSync for local dev (`yarn start`)

## Package manager

Use **Yarn only**. Run `yarn ci` to install, `yarn start` to develop.

## Deployment

- Hosted on GitHub Pages from `main`
- Custom domain: `traleemasjidkicc.ie` (`CNAME` file)
- No build step for production — static files are served as-is

## Scope discipline

- Keep changes minimal and page-appropriate
- Match existing HTML structure, Bootstrap patterns, and JS style
- Do not add frameworks, bundlers, or TypeScript unless explicitly requested
